                                                "sense_id": "d2866a20-b0b8-35c7-a64b-36d7e9d21542",
                                                "text": "\"Right-ho,\" I [Bertie Wooster] said, not much liking the assignment, but liking less the idea of endeavouring to thwart this incandescent aunt in her current frame of mind. Safety first, is the Wooster slogan."
